 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nGroupe Horizon SA                                              MASTER SERVICES\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo, 13001 Marseille, France                AGREEMENT\nN° TVA: FR01 083019600\n\nFROM\nGroupe Horizon SA\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo\n13001 Marseille\nFrance\nVAT: FR01 083019600\n\n                                                              FACTURÉ À\n                                                              Groupe Horizon SA\n                                                              45 Avenue Victor Hugo\n                                                              13001 Marseille\n                                                              France\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 26/04/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Groupe\nHorizon SA, with its registered office at 45 Avenue Victor Hugo, Marseille (\"Party A\"), and Groupe Horizon SA, with its registered office at\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo, Marseille (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Groupe Horizon SA / Sophie Bernard\nParty B      Groupe Horizon SA / Pierre Martin\nDate         26/04/2026\n\nPAYÉ [circled]",
